  "summary": "With over twenty years as a software engineer professional, I have extensive experience in software development, database programming, maintenance, and project management. \n\nAs a manager of software development in a small company, I was responsible for implementing standards and processes, to produce quality products and services. These processes dealt with design architecture, coding standards, reviews, testing, bug fixes verification, builds and customers release processes. Implemented some agile processes such as pair programming, test driven development, and weekly builds.\n\nI am skilled in problem-solving, team building, hands-on leadership skills, and software project life cycle.\n\nSpecialties: Experienced in various computer languages, C, C# Visual Basic, C++, Java. Worked on applications using various databases such as, Oracle, MS Access, and SQL. Knowledgeable of product lifecycle and software development techniques, and agile processes. Experienced in Visual Studio 2008, Eclipse, Visual Studio 2010, and currently learning ASP.Net using Visual Web Developer.    Managing software teams, Team Building. Embedded systems",
